  "solution": "**Given**\n\n(11a3 – 15b3) : (10a3 + 4b3) = 5 : 7\n\n**Calculation**\n\n(11a³ - 15b³)over {(10a³ + 4b³)} = 5over 7\n\n7(11a3 - 15b3) = 5(10a3 + 4b3)\n\n⇒ 77a³ - 105b³ = 50a³ + 20b³\n\n⇒ 27a³ = 125b³\n\n⇒ {{a³}over {b³}} = {125over 27}\n\n⇒ {{aover b}} = {5over 3}\n\n⇒ a = 5bover 3\n\n{{(9 × {5bover 3} + 5b)}} : {{(5 × {5bover 3} - 3b)}}\n\n (3 × 5b + 5b) : {({25bover 3} - 3b)}\n\n⇒ 20b : 16bover 3\n\n({20bover 1}) × ({3over16b})\n\n⇒ 15 : 4\n\n**∴ (9a + 5b) : (5a – 3b) is equal to 15 : 4**\n\n \n\n8a",
